# Environment variable template (services not implemented yet)

Copy to `.env` locally when you start Go / AI / compose. Do not commit real secrets.

## Cluster / Go (future backend-go)

```
KUBECONFIG=
KUBE_CONTEXT=kind-kubeassist-dev
HTTP_ADDR=:8080
AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
AI_SHARED_TOKEN=dev-shared-token-change-me
DATABASE_URL=postgres://kubeassist:kubeassist@localhost:5432/kubeassist?sslmode=disable
POD_LIST_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=10
K8S_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=10
AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=90
```

## Python AI (future ai-service)

```
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
AI_SHARED_TOKEN=dev-shared-token-change-me
LLM_API_KEY=
LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
FAISS_INDEX_DIR=./data/faiss
# When true or when LLM_API_KEY is empty: return schema-valid detector_only_stub / mock_llm diagnosis
LLM_MOCK=true
RAG_TOP_K=5
```

## Frontend (future)

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
```

## Notes

- `LLM_MOCK=true` keeps demos/CI working without billable API calls.
- Postgres is for investigation history only — not for vectors (FAISS stays on disk).
- No Redis or Kafka variables — intentionally unused in MVP.
